      "updated": 1775719920838,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "File permissions are crucial to :\n- protect sensitive files\n- prevent unauthorised access or deletion\n- control what users , groups and programs can do ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "File permissions are crucial to :\n- protect sensitive files\n- prevent unauthorised access or deletion\n- control what users , groups and programs can do ",
