      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1775719920838,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Permission Policies - Whoever needs to give the permission.\nIn our scenario S3 should give the permissions .\n\nWe need to create a permission policy for S3 .. \nwhere  EC2 can access and perform the operation",
      "fontSize": 28,
