    },
    {
      "id": "zQgfpXOgiOghOVtW8Fgqx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 595.999933188652,
      "y": -58132.77362196091,
      "width": 1485,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c0sc",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 283902205,
      "version": 194,
      "versionNonce": 2047807827,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1775719920838,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "i) AWS Service - When the entity is a AWS service like EC2 , lambda ECS etc\n  eg.. you attach thsi role to an EC2 instance \n        > now EC2 can access S3 without access keys  ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "i) AWS Service - When the entity is a AWS service like EC2 , lambda ECS etc\n  eg.. you attach thsi role to an EC2 instance \n        > now EC2 can access S3 without access keys  ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "68AIbd16aa8001T0gh_w0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 577.9671463034065,
      "y": -57970.47853999369,
      "width": 1524.5999755859375,
      "height": 180,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c0sd",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1427954013,
      "version": 448,
      "versionNonce": 1059299677,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1775719920838,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ii) AWS Account - Allows another AWS account (yours or third party) to access\n                  the role\neg.. if Company A wants to let Company B's AWS account access its S3 bucket ,\n     they can create a role",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ii) AWS Account - Allows another AWS account (yours or third party) to access\n                  the role\neg.. if Company A wants to let Company B's AWS account access its S3 bucket ,\n     they can create a role",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "xfhuIahaji23urmlT-JwM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 573.0442076907657,
      "y": -57762.11788425599,
      "width": 1702.800048828125,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c0se",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 575907261,
      "version": 609,
      "versionNonce": 1869049587,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1775719920838,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "iii) Web Identity - Lets users log in using google , facebook , amazon or AWS Cognito \ninsted of AWS username / password",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "iii) Web Identity - Lets users log in using google , facebook , amazon or AWS Cognito \ninsted of AWS username / password",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Xq2KjWC9uD0mns1Fb4Jht",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 576.3228962153571,
      "y": -57640.80640884615,
      "width": 1821.5999755859375,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c0sf",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1269949981,
      "version": 675,
      "versionNonce": 809594301,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1775719920838,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "iv) SAMl - its used in companies with their own corporate Directory\n           Employees log in using their existing office username/password and get AWS access",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "iv) SAMl - its used in companies with their own corporate Directory\n           Employees log in using their existing office username/password and get AWS access",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "sA8qT8MdAs-qkr-gfli8T",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 571.4048634284718,
      "y": -57519.4129662232,
      "width": 1504.800048828125,
      "height": 90,
