      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1775719920838,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Operating system - An operating system is the main system S/w\n that manages the computer hardware , Software resources and\nProvides Services for other programs.\n It acts like a middleman between the hardware and the User(Application) \ne.g - windows , linux , macOS",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Operating system - An operating system is the main system S/w\n that manages the computer hardware , Software resources and\nProvides Services for other programs.\n It acts like a middleman between the hardware and the User(Application) \ne.g - windows , linux , macOS",
