      "text": "Task\n1.list the groups\n2.create two groups (movies) and (songs)\n3.create 4 users (netflix , hotstar , spotify , youtube )\n4.Ad Netflix , hotsar in Movies & spotify , youtube in songs\n5.Set the unique password for both the groups\n6.List the users in both the groups\n7.Remove users from movies\n8.delete the group Songs",
