      "updated": 1775719920838,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Task\n1.Create two users u1 and u2\n2.Under both users create 2 folders [ india & usa ]\n3.Inside each folder create 3 files [ india -> wb tt, ka ,mp\n                                        usa -> ca , te ,fl ]\n4.By acting as u1 try writing content inside one of the text\n  files present under u2 and vice versa.\n5.U1 should be able to modify files inside U2\n  U2 should be able to modify files inside U1\n  ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Task\n1.Create two users u1 and u2\n2.Under both users create 2 folders [ india & usa ]\n3.Inside each folder create 3 files [ india -> wb tt, ka ,mp\n                                        usa -> ca , te ,fl ]\n4.By acting as u1 try writing content inside one of the text\n  files present under u2 and vice versa.\n5.U1 should be able to modify files inside U2\n  U2 should be able to modify files inside U1\n  ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
