      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1775719920838,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "> extension - \".gz\"\n>Simple & Fast compression for individual files\n>It can only compress files not folders\n>If you dont use '-k' flag while compression , the original file \n will be lost .\n> To compress a file : gzip file.txt\n> To Restore the file : gunzip file.txt.gz\n                        gzip -d file.txt.gz   [-d = decompose]\n> To compress with keeping the original file : gzip -k file.txt",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "> extension - \".gz\"\n>Simple & Fast compression for individual files\n>It can only compress files not folders\n>If you dont use '-k' flag while compression , the original file \n will be lost .\n> To compress a file : gzip file.txt\n> To Restore the file : gunzip file.txt.gz\n                        gzip -d file.txt.gz   [-d = decompose]\n> To compress with keeping the original file : gzip -k file.txt",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "dhkC4znsDZ-0tPBIZ5uUE",
