      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "> extension - \".bz2\"\n> Better Compression than gzip but slower\n> It can only compress files not folders\n> use -k flag to keep the original file\n> To compress a file : bzip2 file.txt\n> To restore  a file : bunzip2 file.txt.bz2\n                       bzip2 -d file.txt.bz2   [-d = decompose]",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "> extension - \".bz2\"\n> Better Compression than gzip but slower\n> It can only compress files not folders\n> use -k flag to keep the original file\n> To compress a file : bzip2 file.txt\n> To restore  a file : bunzip2 file.txt.bz2\n                       bzip2 -d file.txt.bz2   [-d = decompose]",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
