      "updated": 1775719920838,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functionalities of OS",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functionalities of OS",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "psYVwa0qUNgaAeSORyFWl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -6960.038182884509,
      "y": -57177.54310215865,
      "width": 915.2000122070312,
      "height": 160,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1Cp",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 409097949,
      "version": 616,
      "versionNonce": 1398470685,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1775719920838,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Process management - Manages running programs (processes) and decides which one gets how much CPU .. \n2. Memory management - Keeps track of memory in use and also manages allocation and deallocation\n                        of memory space\n3. Device Management - Controls and coordinates input/output devices like keyboard , mouse etc\n4. File Management - Handles storing , organizing , retrieval , naming , copying , pasting and \n                        projection of data on a storage device .\n5. User Management - Manages user accounts , passwords , permissions and security for\n                     multi user system",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Process management - Manages running programs (processes) and decides which one gets how much CPU .. \n2. Memory management - Keeps track of memory in use and also manages allocation and deallocation\n                        of memory space\n3. Device Management - Controls and coordinates input/output devices like keyboard , mouse etc\n4. File Management - Handles storing , organizing , retrieval , naming , copying , pasting and \n                        projection of data on a storage device .\n5. User Management - Manages user accounts , passwords , permissions and security for\n                     multi user system",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
