      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1775719920838,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "> Powerful and flexible - with commands we can do more powerful things\n , that aren't available in menus.\n> Faster than clicking through menus\n> Most real world servers don't have GUI\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "> Powerful and flexible - with commands we can do more powerful things\n , that aren't available in menus.\n> Faster than clicking through menus\n> Most real world servers don't have GUI\n",
