    },
    {
      "id": "s2_Ntb198Py-aLe8PHoOf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -6308.309678731505,
      "y": -50736.240917286006,
      "width": 1001,
      "height": 1750,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1Mj",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1357082909,
      "version": 19,
      "versionNonce": 417022781,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1775719920838,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "📂 Folder Structure (Create First)\n~/linux_practice/\n├── projects/\n│   ├── web/\n│   │   └── index.html\n│   ├── data/\n│   │   ├── report.txt\n│   │   └── stats.csv\n│   └── backup/\n│       └── old_data.txt\n└── documents/\n    ├── resume.docx\n    └── notes/\n        └── todo.txt\n\n\n\nmkdir -p ~/linux_practice/projects/{web,data,backup} ~/linux_practice/documents/notes\ntouch ~/linux_practice/projects/web/index.html\ntouch ~/linux_practice/projects/data/{report.txt,stats.csv}\ntouch ~/linux_practice/projects/backup/old_data.txt\ntouch ~/linux_practice/documents/{resume.docx,notes/todo.txt}\n\n\n\n\n\n🔹 Part 1: Copying Files and Folders (cp)\n\nCopy report.txt into the backup folder using absolute path.\n\nCopy the entire data folder into documents using relative path.\n\nCopy resume.docx to /tmp and rename it to resume_copy.docx while copying.\n\nCopy both report.txt and stats.csv into the web folder.\n\n🔹 Part 2: Moving Files and Folders (mv)\n\nMove old_data.txt from backup to data folder.\n\nMove the entire notes folder from documents into web.\n\nMove all .csv files from data into backup folder.\n\n🔹 Part 3: Renaming (Using mv)\n\nRename report.txt to final_report.txt (in the same folder).\n\nRename the folder web to frontend.\n\nMove resume.docx to the backup folder and rename it to resume_2025.docx.\n\n🔹 Part 4: Mixed Path Practice\n\nFrom inside web (or frontend), copy ../../documents/notes/todo.txt into the current folder.\n\nFrom inside backup, move all files to ../data/ using relative path only.\n\nCopy the entire frontend folder to /tmp using absolute path.\n\nRename the main folder linux_practice to linux_lab.\n\n🔹 Bonus Challenges\n\nCopy only newer files from data to backup using the update option.\n\nUse interactive mode to prevent overwriting while copying.\n\nUse wildcards to copy all .txt files from data to backup.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "📂 Folder Structure (Create First)\n~/linux_practice/\n├── projects/\n│   ├── web/\n│   │   └── index.html\n│   ├── data/\n│   │   ├── report.txt\n│   │   └── stats.csv\n│   └── backup/\n│       └── old_data.txt\n└── documents/\n    ├── resume.docx\n    └── notes/\n        └── todo.txt\n\n\n\nmkdir -p ~/linux_practice/projects/{web,data,backup} ~/linux_practice/documents/notes\ntouch ~/linux_practice/projects/web/index.html\ntouch ~/linux_practice/projects/data/{report.txt,stats.csv}\ntouch ~/linux_practice/projects/backup/old_data.txt\ntouch ~/linux_practice/documents/{resume.docx,notes/todo.txt}\n\n\n\n\n\n🔹 Part 1: Copying Files and Folders (cp)\n\nCopy report.txt into the backup folder using absolute path.\n\nCopy the entire data folder into documents using relative path.\n\nCopy resume.docx to /tmp and rename it to resume_copy.docx while copying.\n\nCopy both report.txt and stats.csv into the web folder.\n\n🔹 Part 2: Moving Files and Folders (mv)\n\nMove old_data.txt from backup to data folder.\n\nMove the entire notes folder from documents into web.\n\nMove all .csv files from data into backup folder.\n\n🔹 Part 3: Renaming (Using mv)\n\nRename report.txt to final_report.txt (in the same folder).\n\nRename the folder web to frontend.\n\nMove resume.docx to the backup folder and rename it to resume_2025.docx.\n\n🔹 Part 4: Mixed Path Practice\n\nFrom inside web (or frontend), copy ../../documents/notes/todo.txt into the current folder.\n\nFrom inside backup, move all files to ../data/ using relative path only.\n\nCopy the entire frontend folder to /tmp using absolute path.\n\nRename the main folder linux_practice to linux_lab.\n\n🔹 Bonus Challenges\n\nCopy only newer files from data to backup using the update option.\n\nUse interactive mode to prevent overwriting while copying.\n\nUse wildcards to copy all .txt files from data to backup.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
