      "text": "tasks \n1. sum of the even numbers till 'num'\n2. Reverse a number\n    Input -123\n    output-321\n3. Menu driven Calculator\ninput 1 -> x\ninput 2 -> y\n    1 -> add\n    2 -> substraction\n    3 -> division\n    4 -> Multiplication\n    5 -> exit\n4.Guess the number game\n    target -> 7\nuser will get 5 chances to \nguess the correct number\n- after every guess\nthe console should print\n- the number is higher\nor\n- the number is lower\n-the game will end if the user guessed\nthe correct number",
