      "text": "x-> 5\ny -> 6\n    1 -> add\n    2 -> substraction\n    3 -> division\n    4 -> Multiplication\n    5 -> exit\nenter choice -> 2\n(x+y)\nsum = 11\n 1 -> add\n    2 -> substraction\n    3 -> division\n    4 -> Multiplication\n    5 -> exit\nenter choice -> 5",
