    {
      "id": "VEZNPE0RLanuABPMoum4S",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3001.615617446969,
      "y": -4430.318455291592,
      "width": 572,
      "height": 475,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1Ov",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 983036957,
      "version": 490,
      "versionNonce": 725537981,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1775719920838,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "tasks\n> Create a function in shell scripting \" table() \"\nwhich will take a number as in put and will\ndisplay the multiplication table till 10 (1 - 10)\n5 * 1 = 5\n5 * 2 = 10\n.\n.\n.\n.\n> Calculator \n    sum()\n    sub()\n    mul()\n    div()\n> Write a script to check if a tool exist or not ...\nif it does not exist ... install it for the user ...\nalso show appropriate prompts for each\n> Write a script to check if an user exist or not",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "tasks\n> Create a function in shell scripting \" table() \"\nwhich will take a number as in put and will\ndisplay the multiplication table till 10 (1 - 10)\n5 * 1 = 5\n5 * 2 = 10\n.\n.\n.\n.\n> Calculator \n    sum()\n    sub()\n    mul()\n    div()\n> Write a script to check if a tool exist or not ...\nif it does not exist ... install it for the user ...\nalso show appropriate prompts for each\n> Write a script to check if an user exist or not",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "eWxq3eQFz1WsxXsQpLeFq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2967.884305627833,
      "y": -3854.815132418553,
      "width": 737,
      "height": 325,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1Ow",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1193109629,
      "version": 342,
      "versionNonce": 1280549267,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1775719920838,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "> Write a Script to Create users automatically ...\n     input -> username \n    check if the user is already present or not\n    if present print appropriate message\n    if not ... create the user\n\n> read the username from a file and create the users accordingly ..\nfile > users.txt\n\n\n\n \n    ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "> Write a Script to Create users automatically ...\n     input -> username \n    check if the user is already present or not\n    if present print appropriate message\n    if not ... create the user\n\n> read the username from a file and create the users accordingly ..\nfile > users.txt\n\n\n\n \n    ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
