      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1775719920838,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "> As modifications were done in the same file , so any \n  changes made at any particular instant , tracking them\n  was difficult.\n> Collaboration was not there\n> Any damage to the machine , might lead to loss of source code .\n> May lead to lots of rework and eventually delay in projects .",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "> As modifications were done in the same file , so any \n  changes made at any particular instant , tracking them\n  was difficult.\n> Collaboration was not there\n> Any damage to the machine , might lead to loss of source code .\n> May lead to lots of rework and eventually delay in projects .",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
