      "seed": 1115936541,
      "version": 215,
      "versionNonce": 2036127293,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1775719920838,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "> If there is no stable internet connection , then we cant\n save the versions in a remote server...\n> if any problem occurs to the server ..\n  (physical damage , Server downtime etc) ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "> If there is no stable internet connection , then we cant\n save the versions in a remote server...\n> if any problem occurs to the server ..\n  (physical damage , Server downtime etc) ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
