      "text": "> Linus Torvald introduced git in 2005 , which was totally free to use and \n  was a open source Software .\n> earlier people were using a tool called \"Bitkeeper\"",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
