      "text": "> Linux is multi-user OS , meaning multiple people or services can access the same system\n  so , permissions are crucial to :\n        - protect sensitive files\n        - Prevent unauthorized access or deletions or modification\n        - Control what users , groups and programs can do with my file",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
