      "text": "1. Copy the files under Tirupati to Mysure (Use verbose)\n2. Copy Telengana Folder inside Tirupati\n3. add a file in tirupati and copy it to mysure (use update)\n4. modify the contents in a file in tirupati\n   and again copy paste that file in mysure (use interactive)",
