      "updated": 1775719920839,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "# Important Services -\n\nCompute Category => EC2 , lambda\nStorage => (block,object,file)\nSecurity,Identity and Compliance => IAM , KMS\nNetworking & Content Delivery => VPC , Cloudfront , route53\nDatabase => RDS , DynamoDB\nContainer => Elastic Kubernetes Service\nMonitoring => CloudWatch\nApplication Integration - SNS",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "# Important Services -\n\nCompute Category => EC2 , lambda\nStorage => (block,object,file)\nSecurity,Identity and Compliance => IAM , KMS\nNetworking & Content Delivery => VPC , Cloudfront , route53\nDatabase => RDS , DynamoDB\nContainer => Elastic Kubernetes Service\nMonitoring => CloudWatch\nApplication Integration - SNS",
      "autoResize": true,
