      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "IN AWS , an instance is basically a virtual server that runs on\nthe AWS cloud. Its like a computer (with CPU , RAM , Storage , OS)\nbut instead of running on our desk , its running inside Amazon's\nData Center",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
